 "equipment_type": "Fire / smoke damper controller with airflow measurement",
 "applies_to": "FläktGroup OPTIVENT UltraSafe USFA control units for fire and smoke dampers with ultrasonic airflow measurement.",
 "summary": "The UltraSafe USFA control unit runs a fire/smoke damper with an ultrasonic airflow sensor and an optional duct smoke detector. Its BACnet objects report damper position, current and test results, airflow, temperature and smoke detector values, accept a flow setpoint, manual override, damper test start, external alarm and interlock commands and an alarm reset, and include status bitstrings, trend logs, a PI loop and notification classes.",
