 "access_inferred": false,
 "notes": [
  "BitString Value objects (BSV 0-8) are listed with type Other; their bit texts are in the source.",
  "The Event Log object EL 0 is not listed as a point.",
  "The document prints no engineering units; descriptions give the printed value ranges (comma decimals converted).",
  "AV 2 Volume flow setpoint is used when BV 8 Air flow setpoint source is set to Bus.",
  "MV 4 Damper test result is printed with access W.",
  "This object list does not state the BACnet transport; the PICS it refers to is a separate document."
 ],
